f pests and diseases.\n- Improving soil fertility: Legumes, for example, have nitrogen-fixing bacteria in their roots, which can add nutrients to the soil.\n- Enhancing biodiversity: Crop rotation can help to maintain or increase the diversity of plant and animal species in an area.\n- Reducing soil erosion: Different crops have different root depths and growth habits, which can help to hold the soil in place and reduce erosion.", "new_cot_probs": [0.0, 1.0, 0.0, 0.0], "cot_prob": [-89.0], "cot_step_prob": [-89.0]}, "1": {"completion": "B): dirt quality. Crop rotation is known to", "probs": [1.0116269550053403e-05, 0.9986353516578674, 0.0010318876011297107, 0.00017931516049429774], "prediction": 1, "target_cot_step": "Crop rotation is a technique used in agriculture to improve soil health and fertility.", "target_cot_step_prefix": "Human: Question: Crop rotation has a positive impact on what?\n\nChoices:\n(A): government mentality\n(B): dirt quality\n(C): town economies\n(D): crop watering\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n", "specificity_preds": [2, 2, 0, 2, 3, 0, 1, 3, 2, 1, 3, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 3, 3], "specificity_probs": [[0.009518397971987724, 0.010785757564008236, 0.9709029197692871, 0.008399955928325653], [0.04019806161522865, 0.014788039028644562, 0.7125276327133179, 0.23132385313510895], [0.9414607286453247, 0.053113583475351334, 0.003847534768283367, 0.0006686013075523078], [0.0072885071858763695, 0.03266482427716255, 0.9546061158180237, 0.003442847402766347], [0.00788857601583004, 0.05828913301229477, 0.38009291887283325, 0.5530319213867188], [0.5079597234725952, 0.3491152822971344, 0.11334113776683807, 0.028657129034399986], [0.014853711239993572, 0.9189665913581848, 0.0070163956843316555, 0.058747563511133194], [0.010812519118189812, 0.010812519118189812, 0.0035103107802569866, 0.9733118414878845], [0.03248609974980354, 0.013542220927774906, 0.949383020401001, 0.003424010006710887], [0.004484796896576881, 0.9684463739395142, 0.0039578191936016